<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 29/30.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 29/30.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>28/29. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   May 29/30	 May 28/29</p>
<p> CZK	0.41663	  0 .41267</p>
<p> DKK	2.1		2.10009</p>
<p> FIM	2.65124	  2.65351</p>
<p> HUF	0.07468	  0.07468</p>
<p> JPY	0.11712	  0.11752</p>
<p> LTL	3.4095	   3.40719</p>
<p> LVL     23.89906	 23.9011</p>
<p> RUR	0.00236	  0.00236</p>
<p> SEK	1.76971	  1.77873</p>
<p> UAH	7.33423	  7.3307</p>
<p> USD     13.638	   13.6296</p>
<p> XEU     15.55755	 15.59567</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
